**Changes in `src/tool_wrappers.rs` (172 lines added):**

1. `file_path_to_allow_pattern(path: &str) -> String` — Converts a file path to a directory-based allow pattern:
   • src/main.rs → src/*
   • `src/format/mod.rs → src/format/*`
   • README.md → *.md (root file, extension-based)
   • `Makefile → Makefile` (no extension, exact match)
   • Handles ./ prefix stripping and \ → / normalisation

2. **`already_offered_file_persistence(pattern: &str) -> bool** — Session-level dedup via LazyLock<Mutex<HashSet>>` (same pattern as bash version in tools.rs)

3. **offer_persist_file_pattern(path: &str)** — Prompts user to save the pattern to .yoyo.toml, calls `crate::config::append_allow_pattern`

4. Integration in `confirm_file_operation` — After user says "always" and the always_approved flag is set, `offer_persist_file_pattern(path)` is called

5. 8 new tests covering all pattern generation cases + dedup mechanism

